
~ title

Bandits

=>


~ start

if Regions.is_in(Regions.Forest) or Regions.is_in(Regions.Grasslands)
    As you walk through a particularly [[overgrown|lush]] path, several armed men emerge from the undergrowth, surrounding you.
        [br][br][wait=1] You have been ambushed by bandits!
elif Regions.is_in(Regions.Desert)
    As you walk through a [[small|narrow]] rock [[passage|valley]], several armed men emerge from the surrounding [[rubble|rock face]], surrounding you.
        [br][br][wait=1] You have been ambushed by bandits!

- Fight
	You fight the bandits.
    => fight

	#%.60
	#	do Game.player.apply_stat( CharacterData.Stat.HEALTH, -5.0 )
	#	=> fight_sucess
	#%.40
	#	do Game.player.apply_stat( CharacterData.Stat.HEALTH, -15.0 )
	#	=> fight_failure
		
- Pursuade
	You attempt to pursuade the [[bandits|harrasers]] that you're not worth the trouble.
	%
		They mock you, "Yeah a filthy traveler like you has nothing anyway" and they leave you alone.
	%
		"You think you can fool us" 
        => fight
		#do Game.player.apply_stat( CharacterData.Stat.HEALTH, -10.0 )

- Escape
	%.50
		You sucessfully manage to escape, avoiding any potential harm!
	%.50
		You attempt to run away, however they catch up to you and attack!
        => fight
			#[br][br][wait=1] You manage to fend them off, however, you did not remain unscathed."

=> END


~ fight
set temp["char"] = CharGen.generate_character_from_id( "bandit", 0 )
do temp.char.name = "Bandit"
do temp.char.inventory.set_slot_config_from("human_config")
do temp.char.inventory.equip_all()
do CombatManager.start( temp.char )
_
=> END


~ fight_sucess

You sucessfully defeat them.

=> END

~ fight_failure

They best you.

#- Surrender your belongings
#- Continue fighting

=> END